        <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
          <name>KeepRecordsOfCommissionInMutualSettlementsSwitch</name>
          <id>440</id>
          <visible>true</visible>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
          <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
            <segments>KeepRecordsOfCommissionInMutualSettlementsSwitch</segments>
          </dataPath>
          <titleLocation>None</titleLocation>
          <toolTip>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>In case of AR/AP accounting, write off the commission to expenses using a separate document (UTD). In this case, you can recover VAT.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>در صورت حسابداری دریافتنی/پرداختنی، کارمزد را با سند جداگانه (UTD) به هزینه منظور کنید. در این حالت، می‌توانید مالیات بر ارزش افزوده را بازیافت کنید.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>В случае ведения взаиморасчетов комиссию следует списывать на расходы отдельным документом (УПД). При этом становится возможным возмещение НДС.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Alacak/Borç muhasebesi yapıldığında, komisyon ayrı bir belge (ETB) ile giderlere yazılmalıdır. Bu durumda KDV iadesi mümkün hale gelir.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Khi hạch toán, cần ghi giảm khoản hoa hồng vào chi phí bằng chứng từ riêng biệt (Chứng từ chuyển giao đa năng). Lúc này, sẽ có thể hoàn thuế GTGT.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>In case of AR/AP accounting, write off the commission to expenses using a separate document (UTD). In this case, you can recover VAT.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>In case of AR/AP accounting, write off the commission to expenses using a separate document (UTD). In this case, you can recover VAT.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
          <handlers>
            <event>OnChange</event>
            <name>KeepRecordsOfCommissionInMutualSettlementsSwitchOnChange</name>
          </handlers>
          <extendedTooltip>
            <name>KeepRecordsOfCommissionInMutualSettlementsSwitchExtendedTooltip</name>
            <id>442</id>
            <type>Label</type>
            <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
            <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
              <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
            </extInfo>
          </extendedTooltip>
          <contextMenu>
            <name>KeepRecordsOfCommissionInMutualSettlementsSwitchContextMenu</name>
            <id>441</id>
            <autoFill>true</autoFill>
          </contextMenu>
          <type>RadioButtonField</type>
          <editMode>Enter</editMode>
          <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
          <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
          <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:RadioButtonsFieldExtInfo">
            <choiceList>
              <presentation>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>Write off to expenses</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>منظور کردن به هزینه</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>Списывать на расходы</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>Giderlere yaz</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>Ghi giảm vào chi phí</value>
              </presentation>
              <presentation>
                <key>it</key>
